# Builder packs

## Format

- Ship **`ic-layer-v1` JSON** under `builder/<pack-id>/` plus `builder/manifest.json`.
- Pages CDN only — no PPF, no RomPatcher, no uploading player discs.

## Field encounter densities

Named presets only (`light` / `standard` / `dense` ↔ 25 / 50 / 75). Never invent other rates.

- CLI: omit `--density` to prompt, or pass `--density light|standard|dense|all`
- Helper: `mods/field-random-encounters/scripts/density.py`
- Blurbs: short density text only (no repeated Lure/Away lines)

## Compatibility

- `compatibleBases` must match **live** CSR base ids from the CSR Pages manifest.
- Same-group add-ons use `exclusiveGroup: field-encounter-rate` (one density at a time).
- After CSR releases a new base id, rebuild Field packs here.

## Single-disc apply order

Builder ranks (site `builder.js` `addonApplyRank` — keep in sync with tests):

| Rank | Pack family |
|------|-------------|
| 10 | `single-disc-csr-manip-movies*` |
| 20 | `single-disc-on-*` |
| 30 | `single-disc-endings*` |
| 40+ | encounters / fanfare / other gameplay |
| 50 | `csr-plus-scene-*` |

New single-disc core packs that inject path FMVs must be **bin-diffed after movies**
(so later apply order restores unique-LBA payloads).

## Regression tests

After changing packs, layers, or builder contracts that affect disc output:

```bash
python3 -m pytest tests/ -q -m "not integration"
python3 -m pytest tests/ -q -m integration   # needs discs
```

Extend `tests/` when fixing a regression so it cannot recur silently.

## Commit surface

Commit JSON under `builder/` only — never `.bin` / workspace extracts.
